我父亲觉得我的每段感情之所以不成功
My father thinks the reason I can't make a relationship work

3
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:08,040
是因为我是被宠坏的屁孩
is because I'm spoiled.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,790
好吧  那他到底帮你解决多少账单
All right, how much, exactly, does he pay for?

5
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:15,420
我会告诉你们  但请不要鄙视我
Okay, I'll tell you,but please don't judge me.

6
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:18,960
我的车  我的房租和信用卡的账单都是他付的
He pays for my car, my rent, and my credit cards.

7
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:23,760
我在努力忍住  但我已经鄙视你了
I'm trying, but I'm judging.

8
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:27,560
或许你爸说得对
Maybe your dad's right.

9
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,810
对啊  女人的确喜欢能养活自己的男人
Yeah, women do like a man that can support himself.

10
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,270
我做出了重要决定
I have come to an important decision.

11
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,480
我不会再拿你的钱
I will not be accepting your money anymore.

12
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:35,690
太好了
That's wonderful.

13
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:36,900
是的  非常好
Yes, that is wonderful.

14
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:39,480
你不能再指责我被宠坏了
You will no longer be able to accuse me of being spoiled.

15
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:42,400
-我真为你骄傲  -爸  我是想臭骂你一顿
-I'm so proud of you.  -Dad, I'm trying to tell you off,

16
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:45,030
你的欣喜与宽慰毁了我的计划
and you're ruining it with your delight and relief.

17
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,400
时至今日

18
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:54,540
有意思
Interesting.

19
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,130
好的
Okay.

20
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,300
多糟糕
How bad is it?

21
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:04,180
我这么说吧  你有三尺白绫跟板凳吗

Let me put it this way,do you own a barrel and suspenders?

22
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:06,930
你是说认真的吗
Are you serious?

23
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:09,390
我戴这个遮光帽可不是为了打女子高尔夫
I'm not wearing this visor to play women's golf.

24
