不是你爹帮你付的信用卡账单吗
I thought your dad paid your cards.

34
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:40,460
我有一张自己付款的紧急备用卡
I have a card for emergencies that I pay for myself.

35
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:42,920
在洛城动物园发生了什么紧急事故
What emergency happened at the L.A. Zoo?

36
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:44,590
我认养了一只企鹅
That's a penguin I sponsor.

37
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,050
它们因为全球暖化而失去了家园
They're losing their homes to global warming,

38
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:51,100
而我的车每三公里耗一升油  我挺过意不去
and my car gets, like, seven miles a gallon,so I felt bad.

39
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:54,180
这粉嫩双颊[屁股]是啥
What is Pink Cheeks?

40
00:01:54,390 --> 00:01:56,390
是私密处除毛  那张不许看
It's intimate waxing. Quit looking at that!

41
00:01:59,110 --> 00:02:02,610
或许你该找个人来帮忙让你财务状况回到正轨
Maybe you should find someone to help you get your finances under control.

42
00:02:02,860 --> 00:02:03,860
比如理财经理吗
Like a business manager?

43
