花钱在白痴开销上的人
from spending your money on foolish expenses.

46
00:02:09,830 --> 00:02:12,120
因为那也是白痴开销  而我禁止你这么做
That is a foolish expense, and I forbid it.

47
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:18,210
那如果有一个单纯只是喜欢控制别人
What if there's someone who just likes controlling other people

48
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:20,130
而且乐于将别人生活中的欢乐偷走的人呢
and stealing joy from their lives?

49
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:23,130
他听起来像个反社会变态啊
He sounds like a sociopath.

50
00:02:24,630 --> 00:02:26,720
我们也不确定  他妈妈没带他去检查过这个
We don't know, his mother never had him tested.

51
00:02:30,390 --> 00:02:32,510
你们说的是我  真好笑
You're talking about me. Very funny.

52
00:02:33,470 --> 00:02:36,850
不过我的确是会享受安排好预算
Although I would enjoy drawing up a budget

53
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:40,440
然后逼拉杰坚持计划  而且丝毫不带任何同情心
and forcing Raj to adhere to it without an ounce of compassion.

54
00:02:40,610 --> 00:02:42,730
等等  那谁去跟企鹅说金援要断了
Wait, wait, who's gonna break it to the penguin?

55
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,650
行啊  谢尔顿
Okay, Sheldon.

56
00:02:46,820 --> 00:02:48,450
我的财务就交给你管吧
Yeah, I'm putting you in charge of my finances.

57
00:02:48,610 --> 00:02:50,910
我再也不会花任何一分未经你批准的钱
I will not spend another penny that you don't authorize.

58
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,370
非常好
Very well.

59
00:02:52,530 --> 00:02:55,700
漫展的票这周五开卖  你不许买
Hey, Comic-Con tickets go on sale this Friday. You can't buy one.

60
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:00,210
祝你下次好运啦  粉嫩双颊
Oh, better luck next time, Pink Cheeks.

61
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,500
生

62
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,500
活

63
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,500
大

64
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,500
爆

65
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,500
炸

66
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,500
第十季  第十七集

67
00:03:29,070 --> 00:03:30,700
你真的要去漫展吗
You're actually going to Comic-Con?

68
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,160
莱纳德希望我多陪他做这方面的事
Well, Leonard wants me to do more stuff like that with him,

69
00:03:33,330 --> 00:03:34,870
我就想要不今年陪他去
so I thought maybe this year I'd tag along.

70
00:03:35,290 --> 00:03:37,080
真好  我猜你一定会玩得很开心
Well, that's sweet. I bet you'll have fun.

71
00:03:37,330 --> 00:03:38,410
那你要一起来吗
So, do you want to come?

72
