你老爸愿意宠溺你  但我可以不会
Your father may have spoiled you, but I won't.

106
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:26,480
如果你想要去动漫展的票
If you want a ticket to Comic-Con,

107
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:28,650
那我建议你想办法去挣点外快
I suggest you figure out a way to earn the money yourself.

108
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:31,820
你是个受过高度教育的成人
Yeah, you're a grown man who's highly educated.

109
00:05:31,990 --> 00:05:34,200
你可以收钱当人肉沙包啊
You could charge people money to punch you.

110
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,240
随你嘲讽
Go ahead, make jokes.

111
00:05:38,410 --> 00:05:40,950
我不知道你哪来的自信觉得自己就去得成漫展  你家小孩刚出生
I don't know why you think you're going to Comic-Con-- you just had a baby.

112
00:05:41,790 --> 00:05:42,870
-所以呢  -还所以呢
- So? - Well, so?

113
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,620
所以你觉得伯纳黛特会轻松答应
So you think Bernadette's just gonna let you

