00:07:41,610 --> 00:07:45,540
这是我们餐风露宿排队等去看《复仇者联盟》座谈会
Okay, now, th-this is us camping out in line for the Avengers panel.

155
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:47,750
你们还真睡在人行道上呢
Oh, you really sleep on the sidewalk, huh?

156
00:07:47,910 --> 00:07:50,620
对啊  入夜有时挺冷
Yeah. It can get chilly,

157
00:07:50,870 --> 00:07:53,290
但拉杰想出  如果我们尿在瓶子里
but Raj figured out that if you pee in a bottle

158
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:56,460
然后放进睡袋中能有类似热水袋的作用
and put it in your sleeping bag,it helps keep you warm.

159
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,630
这是我们一起住的酒店房间
Here's the hotel room we all share.

160
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:03,010
到时候我们会单独订一房间的吧
Well, you and I would get our own room, right?

161
00:08:03,470 --> 00:08:04,850
所有酒店都订满了
Every hotel is booked.

162
00:08:05,010 --> 00:08:08,270
不过你看这一块  就是我脑袋跟谢尔顿脚底之间的空间
But, yeah, see this space here between Sheldon's feet and my head?

163
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,730
到时候你就睡这
That's where you go.

164
00:08:11,270 --> 00:08:12,270
这跟以前打雷的时候
Well, it's no different than

165
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:15,900
谢尔顿爬上我们床来跟我们挤没什么两样
when Sheldon used to climb in bed with us during a thunderstorm.

166
00:08:17,110 --> 00:08:19,280
不用担心  反正到时候也不太会睡觉
Don't worry, we won't be doing much sleeping anyway.

167
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,820
那里就像个彻夜狂欢派对
It's like an all-night party.

168
00:08:20,990 --> 00:08:24,120
有冷知识竞赛与《龙与地下城》桌游
There's trivia contests and Dungeons & Dragons.

169
00:08:24,780 --> 00:08:27,490
按我们的话说  就是"乐子[锁子甲]超多"
As we like to say, it's "Off the chain mail."

170
00:08:29,620 --> 00:08:32,790
我甚至说了"锁子超多"  她还是没打退堂鼓

I even said "Off the chain mail," and she still wants to go.

171
00:08:34,830 --> 00:08:36,250
或许这事赖我
That's probably my fault.

172
00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:38,840
可能她耳闻了我的超屌邓布利多变装
She may have heard about my cool Dumbledore costume.

173
00:08:40,970 --> 00:08:42,510
行吧  整盒算你20块
Okay, I can give you 20 bucks for the whole box.

174
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,760
这些东西你以前要我几百块呢
But you charged me hundreds for this stuff.

175
00:08:46,010 --> 00:08:48,220
对啊  而且我都不带眨眼的
I know. And I did it with a straight face.

176
00:08:50,310 --> 00:08:53,810
但我需要挣够足够的钱  我才能去漫展
But I need to earn enough money so I can go to Comic-Con.

177
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,480
好吧
Well... all right.

178
00:08:57,980 --> 00:09:00,820
我给你25块  我最高就出这么多
I'll give you 25 bucks. That's my best offer.

179
00:09:01,990 --> 00:09:02,990
我也别无选择了
I have no choice.

180
00:09:03,570 --> 00:09:06,370
如果你想挣外快  我可以给你点活儿啊
You know, if you want to make extra money,I-I could throw some work your way.

181
00:09:06,660 --> 00:09:08,620
-真的吗  我什么活儿都愿意做  -很好  你被录用了
-Really? I'll do anything.  -Great, you're hired.

182
00:09:08,830 --> 00:09:10,700
先从把这些东西贴上价钱开始
First thing you can do is put price tags on these.

183
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,540
小的那些先贴50块
Start the little ones at $50.

184
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:19,630
也没什么  反正三天而已  我什么都能忍得住
You know, it's no big deal. I can put up with anything for three days.

185
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:22,340
-漫展是五天  -你耍我吧
-Comic-Con's five days.  -Are you kidding me?

186
00:09:25,010 --> 00:09:26,640
你为什么不告诉他你不想去
Why don't you just tell him you don't want to go?

187
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,680
不行  我不想伤他的心
I can't, it'll break his heart.

188
00:09:28,850 --> 00:09:31,770
他总是很努力尝试做那些他不喜欢的事来陪我
You know, he's always making an effort to do things with me he doesn't enjoy,

189
00:09:31,930 --> 00:09:33,480
比如出门
like going outside.

190
00:09:34,890 --> 00:09:36,190
他的确是室内猫类型
He is an indoor cat.

191
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:39,190
或许没想象中那么糟啊
You know, maybe it won't be that bad.

192
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,980
莱纳德说现在宅文化已经是主流文化
Leonard says it's really mainstream now.

193
00:09:41,530 --> 00:09:43,360
漫画不只是给可悲的阿宅看的了
Comic books aren't just for sad nerds anymore.

194
00:09:59,710 --> 00:10:02,260
显然可悲的阿宅在他们族群仍占多数
I mean, it is still a key part of their demographic.

195
00:10:11,010 --> 00:10:12,720
华仔  你能开下门吗
Howie, can you get that?

196
00:10:12,890 --> 00:10:13,980
我在忙
Kind of busy.

197
00:10:14,890 --> 00:10:18,190
有你去圣地亚哥玩耍  而我在家苦逼带孩子时那么忙吗
Busy like I'll be with the baby if you go to San Diego?

198
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,240
这手套是怎么回事
What's with the gloves?

199
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:27,410
跟我这身衣服配套的  有何贵干
They complete my ensemble. What do you want?

200
00:10:29,700 --> 00:10:30,780
我想挣点外快
I'm looking to make extra money

201
00:10:30,950 --> 00:10:32,830
来看看你有没有什么杂活给我干
and was wondering if you had any chores I could do.

202
00:10:33,750 --> 00:10:34,830
稍等
Hang on.

203
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:39,210
妮妮  我可以把我的家务活外包给一个印度人吗
Bernie, can I outsource my chores to an Indian guy?

204
00:10:42,050 --> 00:10:43,250
不行
No.

205
00:10:43,710 --> 00:10:44,710
我尽力了
I tried.

206
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:51,640
我在想如果你想穿情侣装
Hey, I was thinking, if you want to do a couples costume,

207
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:54,470
我们可以把自己刷成绿色  扮成绿巨人和女绿巨人
we could paint ourselves green and be Hulk and She-Hulk.

208
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:58,600
又或者我们可以把自己刷成蓝色扮成夜行者和变形女
Or we could paint ourselves blue and go as Nightcrawler and Mystique.

209
00:11:00,690 --> 00:11:02,940
有没有不用全身刷漆的方案
Is there any scenario where we're not in full body paint?

210
00:11:04,070 --> 00:11:06,690
有啊  如果你想我们看起来逊爆了的话
Yeah, if you want us to look like losers.

211
00:11:07,070 --> 00:11:10,030
你确定其他三人不介意我也一起去吗
Hey, um, are you sure the guys are okay with me coming?

212
00:11:10,570 --> 00:11:11,620
当然啦  为什么这么问
Yeah, of course, why?

213
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:14,290
就是通常都是你们四个一起去
This is just something you usually do together,

214
00:11:14,450 --> 00:11:16,000
如果我去会破坏气氛  我也不是非得去
and if I'm screwing it up, I don't have to go.

215
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:19,620
怎么了  你不想去吗
Oh, why? Do you not want to go?

216
00:11:21,790 --> 00:11:23,500
怎么了  你不想我去吗
Why? Do you not want me to go?

217
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:26,800
不  我当然想你去
No, I want you to go.

218
00:11:29,340 --> 00:11:32,640
那就好  因为我也想去
Okay, good, 'cause that's what I want, too.

219
00:11:37,310 --> 00:11:40,100
现在我们得以绿巨人和女绿巨人的装扮出现
Now we're going as Hulk and She-Hulk.

220
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:44,320
我不想在漫展上脱掉上衣啊
I don't want to take my shirt off at Comic-Con.

221
00:11:45,190 --> 00:11:47,900
如果我能代漫展发言  我会说我们也不希望这事发生
If I may speak for Comic-Con, we don't want that either.

222
00:11:49,860 --> 00:11:50,860
需要这么毒吗
Is that nice?

223
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:52,280
不用  但至少诚实啊
No, but it's honest,

224
00:11:52,450 --> 00:11:55,120
而且感觉起来你们的感情也需要多一点真诚
and it sounds like you could use a little more honesty in your relationship.

225
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:57,330
实际情况远比嘴上说来得复杂
Uh, I-it's more complicated than that.

226
00:11:57,950 --> 00:11:59,330
我一直诚实对待艾米
I'm always honest with Amy.

227
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:01,290
有一天她说觉得难为情
The other day she said she was self-conscious

228
00:12:01,460 --> 00:12:03,420
因为肩膀上有颗美人印
about the beauty mark on her shoulder,

229
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:05,800
而我说  "随你美化你那个美人印
and I said, "You know, you can call that a beauty mark all you want.

230
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:08,760
但当它上面长了根毛  那它就是个痣"
When there's hair growing out of it, that's a mole."

231
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,430
你觉得她也对你如此诚实吗
Do you think she's as honest with you?

232
00:12:12,970 --> 00:12:14,010
我希望是如此
I should hope so.

233
00:12:14,180 --> 00:12:17,930
当她称我为没心没肺的混蛋时  我会希望她是真心的
When she called me an insensitive jerk,I'd like to think she meant it.

234
00:12:21,020 --> 00:12:23,650
肯定有其他让你挣外快的法子
There's got to be other ways you can make a quick buck.

235
00:12:23,860 --> 00:12:24,860
哪这么容易找
Yeah, you'd think.

236
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:27,820
或许我可以去卖血卖精子
Ooh, maybe I could sell my blood and sperm.

237
00:12:31,570 --> 00:12:34,530
我真应该在脖子上系个铃铛  这样我一来  你们就能听见
I really should wear a bell around my neck so you guys can hear me coming.

238
00:12:35,410 --> 00:12:37,990
-来  我帮你吧  -谢谢
-Here, let me help you.  -Thank you.

239
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:41,290
双层夹心奥利奥  我还记得当初我吃得起的日子
Oh, Double Stuf Oreos,I remember when I could afford you.

240
00:12:43,210 --> 00:12:45,880
-哈雷又哭了  -你待着  我去吧
-There she goes.  -Stay, I'll get her.

241
00:12:46,420 --> 00:12:49,710
-非常感谢  -不客气  我可以和她一起抱头痛哭
- Appreciate it. - That's fine.She and I can cry together.

242
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:52,430
他真是个好人
He's such a sweetie.

243
00:12:53,050 --> 00:12:55,930
我知道  真希望我们能有办法帮他
I know, I wish there was some way we could help him.

244
00:12:56,510 --> 00:12:59,270
如果他可以找到一个薪水高的女朋友  那他所有的问题将迎刃而解
If he could find a girl with a good job,all his problems would be over.

245
00:12:59,430 --> 00:13:01,350
是啊  看我现在过得多"好"
Yeah, that's working out great for me.

246
00:13:05,900 --> 00:13:07,360
佩妮说他们准备好出发了
Penny says they're ready to go.

247
00:13:07,770 --> 00:13:11,440
很好  准备迎接漫长的欺骗夜吧
Very well.Prepare for a long night of deceit.

248
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:16,120
谢尔顿  女人可以化妆  那不叫欺骗
Sheldon, women can wear makeup, it's not lying.

249
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:19,620
我刚说的是莱纳德
I was talking about Leonard.

250
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:23,080
而且如果化妆品这么诚我不欺  那为什么有化妆品叫"遮瑕膏"[隐瞒者]
And if makeup is so truthful,why is it called "Concealer"?

251
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,960
等等  莱纳德欺骗什么了
Wait, wait, wait, what's Leonard lying about?

252
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:28,920
他其实不想佩妮去漫展
He doesn't really want Penny to go to Comic-Con.

253
00:13:29,090 --> 00:13:30,510
他是为了让她开心才带她去
He's just doing it to make her happy.

254
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:32,720
真的吗
Really?

255
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:36,430
因为佩妮其实并不想去漫展  她是为了让他开心才跟他去
Because she doesn't actually want to go.She's just doing it to make him happy.

256
00:13:37,260 --> 00:13:38,970
所以他们俩的本意是想让对方开心
So they're both trying to make each other happy,

257
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:41,810
而结果却是让彼此恶心吗
and the end result is they make each other sad?

258
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:44,270
真是太可笑了
That's hilarious.

259
00:13:46,850 --> 00:13:48,230
我等不及要告诉他们了
I can't wait to tell them.

260
00:13:49,270 --> 00:13:52,030
不  你不能拆穿他们  你不许插手这件事
No, you're not gonna tell them anything.You're gonna stay out of it.

261
00:13:52,610 --> 00:13:54,740
-为什么  -因为这是他们之间的事
-Why?  -Because it's between them.

262
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:59,330
你难道没注意到吗  过去十年里我一直生活在他们之间
Well, if you haven't noticed,I've been between them for the last ten years.

263
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,120
-你好  -嗨
- Hello.  - Hi.

264
00:14:03,290 --> 00:14:05,040
-宝贝  你想开车吗  -当然  不过你开也行
-Hey, babe, you want to drive?  -Sure, or you can.

265
00:14:05,210 --> 00:14:07,460
没关系  我知道你不喜欢我开车的方式
No, it's fine, I know you don't like the way I drive.

266
00:14:07,630 --> 00:14:09,290
我对你开车技术没有意见啊
I don't have a problem with your driving.

267
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:12,630
你听见他们的鬼话了吗  他们在所有事情上都欺骗对方
Are you listening to this? They deceive each other about everything.

268
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:13,800
嘘
Shh.

269
00:14:16,630 --> 00:14:19,760
我告诉你  是停车场那家伙撞我
Just so you know, that guy in the parking lot hit me.

270
00:14:20,390 --> 00:14:22,350
他当时都不在车上好吗  不过行吧
He wasn't in a car, but okay.

271
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:26,060
你直说你想开不得了
Just say you want to drive.

272
00:14:26,230 --> 00:14:27,650
我真的不想开
I honestly don't.

273
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,820
艾米  帮个忙  你开车吧
Amy, do us a favor, please drive.

274
00:14:33,990 --> 00:14:35,150
好  乐意效劳
Sure, happy to.

275
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,530
如果你想开车  那就开啊
If you want to drive, just drive.

276
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:38,410
我不懂为什么要搞得这么复杂
I don't see why this has to be so complicated.

277
00:14:38,570 --> 00:14:40,580
一点都不复杂  艾米开车  就这样
It's not complicated. Amy's driving, that's it!

278
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:42,490
才不是  谁都看得出你不高兴
That's not it because you're clearly upset.

279
00:14:42,660 --> 00:14:44,200
你才是看上去不高兴的那个
You're the one who seems upset.

280
00:14:44,370 --> 00:14:45,370
我为什么要不高兴
Why would I be upset?

281
00:14:45,540 --> 00:14:47,420
因为你不想她去参加漫展
Because you don't want her to go to Comic-Con!

282
00:14:50,670 --> 00:14:52,960
这种"不插手"的方式真是相当有意思啊
This is an interesting way to stay out of it.

283
00:14:55,510 --> 00:14:57,170
慢着  你不想我去吗
Wait, you don't want me to go?

284
00:14:57,340 --> 00:15:00,300
我只是觉得你不会觉得好玩
Well, I just don't think you're gonna have a good time.

285
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:04,020
是啊  听好了  佩妮也是这么想的  所以她并不想去
Yeah, well, get this: neither does Penny,that's why she doesn't want to go.

286
00:15:06,140 --> 00:15:07,890
你下套  我下刀  合作无间
You set 'em up, I knock 'em down, good job.

287
00:15:09,850 --> 00:15:12,020
如果你不想去  为什么你不直说
Why would you say you wanted to go if you didn't?

288
00:15:12,190 --> 00:15:13,690
我本以为跟着去会让你开心
I just thought it would make you happy.

289
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:17,240
好吧  等等  如果你不想跟去
O-O-O-Okay, hold on, so if you don't want to go

290
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,110
而我也不必带你去
and I don't need to bring you,

291
00:15:19,950 --> 00:15:21,070
我们还是恩爱好夫妻吧
is everything good?

292
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:24,160
等等  我先决定我是不是在生你气
Hold on, I'm trying to decide if I'm mad at you.

293
00:15:26,330 --> 00:15:28,040
不会  不用去我很开心
No, I'm happy I don't have to go.

294
00:15:29,250 --> 00:15:31,380
-好啦  问题解决  -没错
-All right, problem solved.  - Okay.

295
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:33,710
还没完呢  刚才不是还在吵谁开车吗
Not entirely, the fight over who's going to drive is still...

296
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,380
天啊  快把嘴闭上
Oh, my God, stop talking!

297
00:15:38,590 --> 00:15:40,590
家里看着好干净啊  你们请佣人了吗
The place looks great.Did you guys get a maid?

298
00:15:41,390 --> 00:15:42,550
算是吧
Kind of.

299
00:15:44,260 --> 00:15:45,390
晚餐快好了
Dinner's almost ready.

300
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:49,940
如果你们喜欢烘肉卷  那肯定会喜欢它的表亲大碗肉
If you like meatloaf, I'm sure you'll like its cousin,bowl of meat.

301
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:55,980
如果你还想着挣外快  我愿意付钱让你把外套烧了
Hey, if you're still looking to make money,I will pay you to burn that jacket.

302
00:15:59,110 --> 00:16:02,280
谢谢  但看来今年我是无缘漫展了
Thank you, but it doesn't look like I'm going to Comic-Con this year.

303
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:05,790
你有这么多债务在身  明年应该也不能去
Well, with as much debt as you have, probably not next year either.

304
00:16:08,250 --> 00:16:09,750
-华仔  -好的
- Howie? - Sure.

305
00:16:09,910 --> 00:16:11,540
这是给你的
This is for you.

306
00:16:13,290 --> 00:16:14,290
这是什么
What's this?

307
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:17,840
补发工资  之前你给我们当保姆  还有照顾哈雷的酬劳
It's back pay for all the babysitting and taking care of Halley you've done.

308
00:16:18,260 --> 00:16:21,090
里面的钱就算你去参加漫展还绰绰有余
There's more than enough in there to cover Comic-Con.

309
00:16:21,470 --> 00:16:23,930
我也帮忙照顾哈雷了啊
Um, I also take care of Halley.

310
00:16:25,810 --> 00:16:27,770
你也在这里白住了啊
And you live here for free.

311
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,480
的确如此  夫人  多谢收留  夫人
I do, ma'am, thank you, ma'am.

312
00:16:31,940 --> 00:16:35,190
你们真是太慷慨了  我...我都不知道该说什么了
This is so generous of you,I-I, um, I don't know what to say.

313
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:36,570
现在你可以跟我们一起去了
Now you can come with us.

314
00:16:36,730 --> 00:16:39,070
对啊  谢尔顿脚边还有地方睡哦
Yeah, there's room in the bed by Sheldon's feet.

315
00:16:41,610 --> 00:16:43,660
尽管我很感激你们给我这笔钱  可我不能收
As much as I appreciate this,I can't accept it.

316
00:16:43,990 --> 00:16:46,990
好吗  哈雷是我的教女  我照顾她是应该的  不是为了钱
Okay? Halley's my goddaughter, I don't take care of her for money.

317
00:16:47,450 --> 00:16:48,540
我是
I would.

318
00:16:52,540 --> 00:16:53,870
留着吧  就当是我们送你的礼物
Keep it. Consider it a gift.

319
00:16:54,170 --> 00:16:56,790
等等  这到底是补发工资还是礼物
Hold on. Is it back pay or is it a gift?

320
00:16:57,130 --> 00:16:58,130
有什么区别吗
What's the difference?

321
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:00,050
当我们被关在不同房间被国税局审问时
When the IRS questions us in separate rooms,

322
00:17:00,210 --> 00:17:01,510
我们的答案必须一致啊
we need to have our stories straight.

323
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:04,840
无所谓啦  反正我不会收下
It doesn't matter. I'm not keeping this.

324
00:17:05,010 --> 00:17:06,930
我正努力自食其力  做一个有担当的人
I'm trying to pay my own way and be responsible.

325
00:17:07,100 --> 00:17:08,760
拿别人白给的钱可不行
Taking handouts won't help that.

326
00:17:09,310 --> 00:17:10,730
所以你不去参加漫展了吗
So you're not going to Comic-Con?

327
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:13,100
反正我去过很多次了
I've been plenty of times.

328
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:15,810
少去一次也没关系  我是个成年人了
If I miss one, it's fine. I'm a big boy.

329
00:17:16,810 --> 00:17:20,230
我也是成年人  但如果我少去了一次  我就会发成年人的脾气
I'm a big boy, and if I missed one,I'd throw a big-boy tantrum.

330
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:25,160
其实我都去了12次了
You know what? I've gone 12 times.

331
00:17:25,320 --> 00:17:26,870
要不今年我也不参加了吧
Maybe I'll sit out this year, too.

332
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:28,030
-真的吗  -真的
- Really? - Yeah.

333
00:17:28,410 --> 00:17:30,240
或许我们那周末可以找点好玩的事情干
Maybe you and I can do something fun that weekend.

334
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:32,250
一起去漂流怎么样
Ooh, how about white-water rafting?

335
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:37,000
乘坐小船游览由身穿各地民族服饰的木偶
和活动布景组成的全球七大洲

336
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:37,000
不如我们折中一下  去迪士尼玩小小世界之旅
Oh... how about we compromise and go on the Small World ride at Disneyland?

337
00:17:40,250 --> 00:17:42,510
要不我也不去了
You know what, I'm not gonna go either.

338
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:46,640
我现在身为人父  我更愿意跟家人待在一起
I'm a father now. I'd rather spend time with my family.

339
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:48,800
你只是不想跟谢尔顿两人一起去
You just don't want to go alone with Sheldon.

340
00:17:48,970 --> 00:17:50,560
我去看看晚餐好了没
I'm gonna go check on dinner.

341
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:56,350
听起来大家都不去了  那你怎么说
Sounds like everyone's staying home. What do you say?

342
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:59,270
谁不去谁傻逼  反正我是要去
Nuts to that, I'm going to Comic-Con!

343
00:18:00,860 --> 00:18:01,860
就你自己去吗
By yourself?

344
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:03,320
不一定啊
Not necessarily.

345
00:18:03,490 --> 00:18:05,740
我还有四个月的时间找新朋友陪我去
I have four months to find some new friends.

346
00:18:06,410 --> 00:18:07,530
我陪你去
I'll go with you.

347
00:18:07,870 --> 00:18:09,280
你人真好  斯图尔特
That's very kind of you, Stuart.

348
00:18:09,700 --> 00:18:11,370
等七月的时候你再问我一次
Check back in with me in July.

349
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:22,090
瞧瞧我的漂亮女友
There's my pretty girlfriend.

350
00:18:25,090 --> 00:18:27,220
我是不会跟你去漫展的
I'm not going with you to Comic-Con.

351
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:30,850
干嘛  难道就不能因为见到自己女人很开心
What? Can't a man just be happy to see his woman

352
00:18:31,010 --> 00:18:34,730
然后就拍拍她第二性感的部位球窝关节吗
and pat her on her second most erogenous ball-and-socket joint?

353
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:40,730
能啊  但我还是不会改变主意
He can, but it's still not changing my mind.

354
00:18:42,610 --> 00:18:45,240
或许我裤裆里的东西能让你改变主意
Well, maybe what's in my pants will change your mind.

355
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:52,410
这是今年明星座谈会的嘉宾名单
It's a list of this year's panelists.

356
00:18:57,290 --> 00:18:58,580
很长  对不对
It's long, isn't it?

